### ============================================================================
### Player Scout API — 99. Fluxo Completo Fim a Fim (Auto-Encadeado)
### Clique em "Send Request" de cima para baixo: todas as variáveis de ID
### ({{createCoachTech.response.body.id}}, etc.) são preenchidas automaticamente!
### ============================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api/v1
@runId = {{$guid}}

### Passo 1: Health Check da API
# @name healthCheck
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
Accept: application/json

###

### Passo 2: Criar Treinador Técnico (Coach 1)
# @name createCoachTech
POST {{baseUrl}}/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "role": "coach",
  "name": "Treinador Técnico Padel",
  "email": "coach.tech.{{runId}}@playerscout.example",
  "password_hash": "hash_ficticio_coach_tech"
}

###

### Passo 3: Criar Treinador Tático (Coach 2)
# @name createCoachTactical
POST {{baseUrl}}/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "role": "coach",
  "name": "Treinador Tático Padel",
  "email": "coach.tactical.{{runId}}@playerscout.example",
  "password_hash": "hash_ficticio_coach_tactical"
}

###

### Passo 4: Criar Usuário com Perfil Player (Atleta Read-Only)
# @name createAthleteUser
POST {{baseUrl}}/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "role": "player",
  "name": "Atleta Exemplo",
  "email": "atleta.{{runId}}@playerscout.example",
  "password_hash": "hash_ficticio_atleta"
}

###

### Passo 5: Cadastrar Ficha do Atleta vinculada ao Usuário Player
# @name createPlayerProfile
POST {{baseUrl}}/players
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "actor_id": "{{createCoachTech.response.body.id}}",
  "user_id": "{{createAthleteUser.response.body.id}}",
  "name": "Atleta Exemplo",
  "dominant_hand": "right_handed",
  "preferred_side": "left",
  "category": "1ª Categoria"
}

###

### Passo 6: Vincular o Segundo Treinador (Tático) ao mesmo Atleta (Relação N:N)
# @name assignSecondCoach
POST {{baseUrl}}/players/{{createPlayerProfile.response.body.id}}/coaches
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "actor_id": "{{createCoachTech.response.body.id}}",
  "coach_id": "{{createCoachTactical.response.body.id}}"
}

###

### Passo 7: Listar Treinadores do Atleta (Consultado pelo próprio Atleta)
# @name listPlayerCoaches
GET {{baseUrl}}/players/{{createPlayerProfile.response.body.id}}/coaches?actor_id={{createAthleteUser.response.body.id}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Passo 8: Criar Partida para o Atleta (Iniciada pelo Treinador Tático)
# @name createMatch
POST {{baseUrl}}/matches
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "actor_id": "{{createCoachTactical.response.body.id}}",
  "player_id": "{{createPlayerProfile.response.body.id}}",
  "opponent_name": "Dupla Visitante",
  "notes": "Torneio Regional - Quadra Central"
}

###

### Passo 9: Registrar Jogada 1 — Saque Acertou (Decisão Boa por padrão)
# @name shot1
POST {{baseUrl}}/matches/{{createMatch.response.body.id}}/shots
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "actor_id": "{{createCoachTactical.response.body.id}}",
  "player_id": "{{createPlayerProfile.response.body.id}}",
  "set_number": 1,
  "shot_type": "saque",
  "outcome": "hit"
}

###

### Passo 10: Registrar Jogada 2 — Smash x3 Winner (Acertou + Boa + Winner)
# @name shot2
POST {{baseUrl}}/matches/{{createMatch.response.body.id}}/shots
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "actor_id": "{{createCoachTactical.response.body.id}}",
  "player_id": "{{createPlayerProfile.response.body.id}}",
  "set_number": 1,
  "shot_type": "smash_x3",
  "outcome": "hit",
  "decision": "good",
  "special_tag": "winner"
}

###

### Passo 11: Registrar Jogada 3 — Bajada de Parede (Errou + Decisão Ruim + Erro Não Forçado)
# @name shot3
POST {{baseUrl}}/matches/{{createMatch.response.body.id}}/shots
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "actor_id": "{{createCoachTactical.response.body.id}}",
  "player_id": "{{createPlayerProfile.response.body.id}}",
  "set_number": 1,
  "shot_type": "bajada_parede",
  "outcome": "miss",
  "decision": "bad",
  "special_tag": "unforced_error"
}

###

### Passo 12: Desfazer Última Jogada (Undo da Jogada 3)
# @name undoShot3
POST {{baseUrl}}/matches/{{createMatch.response.body.id}}/shots/undo
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "actor_id": "{{createCoachTactical.response.body.id}}"
}

###

### Passo 13: Consultar Jogadas Restantes da Partida como Atleta (Read-Only)
# @name listMatchShots
GET {{baseUrl}}/matches/{{createMatch.response.body.id}}/shots?actor_id={{createAthleteUser.response.body.id}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Passo 14: Registrar Jogada no Set 2 — Voleio Direita Winner
# @name shotSet2
POST {{baseUrl}}/matches/{{createMatch.response.body.id}}/shots
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "actor_id": "{{createCoachTactical.response.body.id}}",
  "player_id": "{{createPlayerProfile.response.body.id}}",
  "set_number": 2,
  "shot_type": "voleio_direita",
  "outcome": "hit",
  "decision": "good",
  "special_tag": "winner"
}

###

### Passo 15: Consultar Relatório Analítico Recursivo da Partida (Matriz 4 Quadrantes + Radar 6 Fases)
# @name getPlayerAnalytics
GET {{baseUrl}}/analytics/players/{{createPlayerProfile.response.body.id}}?actor_id={{createAthleteUser.response.body.id}}&match_id={{createMatch.response.body.id}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Passo 16: Modo Comparativo Lado a Lado — Set 1 vs Set 2
# @name compareSet1VsSet2
POST {{baseUrl}}/analytics/compare
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "actor_id": "{{createAthleteUser.response.body.id}}",
  "player_id": "{{createPlayerProfile.response.body.id}}",
  "scope_a": {
    "match_id": "{{createMatch.response.body.id}}",
    "set_number": 1,
    "from_date": null,
    "to_date": null
  },
  "scope_b": {
    "match_id": "{{createMatch.response.body.id}}",
    "set_number": 2,
    "from_date": null,
    "to_date": null
  }
}

###

### Passo 17: Cadastro Completo (Fase 4.5) com Argon2i, Posição em Quadra e Criação Automática de Perfil Player
# @name registerFullPlayer
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "first_name": "Agustín",
  "last_name": "Tapia",
  "age": 25,
  "cpf": "390.533.447-05",
  "email": "tapia.{{$guid}}@playerscout.test",
  "whatsapp_phone": "(51) 99111-2233",
  "cep": "90570-020",
  "street": "Rua Padre Chagas",
  "street_number": "500",
  "complement": "Bloco B",
  "neighborhood": "Moinhos de Vento",
  "city": "Porto Alegre",
  "state": "RS",
  "role": "player",
  "preferred_side": "left",
  "dominant_hand": "right_handed",
  "password": "TapiaMozart2026!@"
}

###

### Passo 18: Login Exclusivo por E-mail com Verificação Argon2i
# @name loginFullPlayer
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{registerFullPlayer.response.body.user.email}}",
  "password": "TapiaMozart2026!@"
}

###

### Passo 19: Busca de Usuário pela Chave Única (CPF ou E-mail)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/lookup?cpf=39053344705
Accept: application/json

###

### Passo 20: Obter URL de Autorização OAuth2 (Google / Gmail)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/oauth/google/authorize
Accept: application/json

